'''Xmas''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it for 75 [[Gifts 2015|Gifts]] {{Currency|Gift2015}} through the [[shop]] during the [[Christmas Event 2015|2015 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is a Christmas tree decorated in ornaments with a yellow star placed on the tip. The guard is a red tree stand, and the handle is made up of four multicolored gifts stacked on top of each other.

==Trivia==
*This was the cheapest [[Knives|knife]] obtainable during the [[Christmas Event 2015]].
*This was the only [[Crafting|craftable]] godly during the event that didn't require another item to craft it.
*Its model derives from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/189756588/Christmas-Tree-Sword Christmas Tree Sword], purchasable from the avatar shop for 700 Robux.
*It appeared as [[Murder Mystery 2|Murder Mystery 2’s]] icon upon the release of the [[Christmas Event 2018|2018 Christmas Event]].
*When salvaged, it provides 38 godly [[Shards|shards]].
*It is commonly paired with [[Jinglegun]], a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun obtainable by giving 100 [[gifts]] to players during the [[Christmas Event 2020]].

